                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "yeah i figured.\r\nI only find the hunks navigation a bit awkward as you have to extend your hand a little for `]` and use the same hand finger for pressing `h` then which slows it down a bit if you're trying to navigate quickly through hunks but i believe i have quite large hands so it's skill issue on my part lol.\r\nI should try to use the other hand which might be a good solution.\r\nThank you for your plugins!",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">yeah i figured.<br>\nI only find the hunks navigation a bit awkward as you have to extend your hand a little for <code class=\"notranslate\">]</code> and use the same hand finger for pressing <code class=\"notranslate\">h</code> then which slows it down a bit if you're trying to navigate quickly through hunks but i believe i have quite large hands so it's skill issue on my part lol.<br>\nI should try to use the other hand which might be a good solution.<br>\nThank you for your plugins!</p>",
                    "bodyText": "yeah i figured.\nI only find the hunks navigation a bit awkward as you have to extend your hand a little for ] and use the same hand finger for pressing h then which slows it down a bit if you're trying to navigate quickly through hunks but i believe i have quite large hands so it's skill issue on my part lol.\nI should try to use the other hand which might be a good solution.\nThank you for your plugins!",
